on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 16 ............................. <16>
  [  2] pushint8 20 ............................. <20>
  [  4] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [  6] get 6 ................................... <the locH of sprite 20>
  [  8] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [ 10] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite 16 to the locH of sprite 20
  [ 12] pushint8 16 ............................. <16>
  [ 14] pushint8 20 ............................. <20>
  [ 16] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 18] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 20>
  [ 20] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 22] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 16 to the locV of sprite 20
  [ 24] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 26] extcall 12 .............................. updateStage()
  [ 28] ret
end
